From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AbelDuan <32724782+AbelDuan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:41:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 15/25] fix(meituan): follow the native slot count instead of a
 fixed five

Meituan 12.69.402 removed the video tab from the home bar: TabBlockV2 now
wraps a PTLinearLayout with four tab slots, while the adapter still
reported SLOT_COUNT=5. The framework then laid out five slots over four
native cells, so selection, tap routing and the detached publish layout
all indexed the wrong tab.

The row's live cells are now the slot count, selection and taps use slot
positions, the artwork bounds are keyed by slot, and a persisted mask bit
for a slot the bar no longer has is dropped instead of hiding whatever
tab moved into that position.
